From 61b9691da57dbb6735566213dc57c23e33e5bb04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ci <a@b>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:10:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: sprd-vsp: add an experimental stateless H.264 decoder

Register a V4L2 stateless (slice-based, Annex B) decoder on the UMS9230
video codec. The register programming follows the vendor's AVC library as
far as it has been reverse engineered: bitstream module set-up, current
picture buffers, the packed sequence/slice parameter words and the
start/interrupt sequence.

It has not run on hardware yet. Only I and SI slices are handled, because
the reference picture registers are not understood, and scaling matrices
are not supported. P and B slices fail the request.
